  Offer: There's a bear in the south-east glade older than this trading post. It charges anyone who comes near its den and it doesn't tire. Bring friends. Keep your distance, and when it roars, move.
  Task: Bring down the Old Bear of the Pines
  Waiting: It heals if you all run off. Stay on it, and stay out of its reach.
  Done: The Old Bear... I never thought I'd see the day. The whole forest will be talking about you.
